Only past events from this request's principal count.

@id("forbid_read_when_transfers_over_1000")
FORBID any principal to perform Read on any resource
  when:
    (the sum of a over the distinct (a, t) for which within the last 1 hour, at some point:
      the event is a Transfer response with this request's user and output amount = a
      and a > 0
      and that timepoint is t) > 1000
